{
  "story_id": "inn-at-the-crossroads",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 361128,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Yiayia gave the man tea.",
      "start_ms": 1894,
      "end_ms": 3716
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She did not offer him food — he said he was not hungry — but she made him tea in a heavy mug and set it in front of him.",
      "start_ms": 3716,
      "end_ms": 12532
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She sat down across from him.",
      "start_ms": 12532,
      "end_ms": 14718
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "She did not say anything.",
      "start_ms": 14718,
      "end_ms": 16613
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Kostas sat at the next table with his book.",
      "start_ms": 16613,
      "end_ms": 19819
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He pretended to read.",
      "start_ms": 19819,
      "end_ms": 21422
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "The man drank his tea.",
      "start_ms": 21422,
      "end_ms": 23098
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "He was quiet for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 23098,
      "end_ms": 25283
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "He did not look at anything in particular.",
      "start_ms": 25283,
      "end_ms": 28417
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Once he closed his eyes and kept them closed for maybe a minute.",
      "start_ms": 28417,
      "end_ms": 33226
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Finally, without looking at Yiayia, he said, \"I was not going to stop here.",
      "start_ms": 33226,
      "end_ms": 38763
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "I did not know there was a place.",
      "start_ms": 38763,
      "end_ms": 41241
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I was riding through.",
      "start_ms": 41241,
      "end_ms": 42843
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I do not know why I stopped.\" Yiayia said, in her soft voice, \"That is fine.",
      "start_ms": 42843,
      "end_ms": 48454
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "You are here now.",
      "start_ms": 48454,
      "end_ms": 49765
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "You can sleep upstairs.",
      "start_ms": 49765,
      "end_ms": 51514
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "In the morning you can go on.",
      "start_ms": 51514,
      "end_ms": 53700
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "There is no need to explain anything.\" The man looked at her for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 53700,
      "end_ms": 59165
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "He said, \"I was thinking about doing something bad.",
      "start_ms": 59165,
      "end_ms": 62954
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Something to myself.",
      "start_ms": 62954,
      "end_ms": 64484
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "It is why I was riding tonight.",
      "start_ms": 64484,
      "end_ms": 66815
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "To think about it.",
      "start_ms": 66815,
      "end_ms": 68200
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I stopped here — I do not know why.",
      "start_ms": 68200,
      "end_ms": 70823
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "I just did.\" He was quiet again.",
      "start_ms": 70823,
      "end_ms": 73300
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Yiayia did not say anything for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 73300,
      "end_ms": 76579
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "She did not react quickly.",
      "start_ms": 76579,
      "end_ms": 78546
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "She looked down at her hands on the table.",
      "start_ms": 78546,
      "end_ms": 81680
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Kostas did not move.",
      "start_ms": 81680,
      "end_ms": 83210
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "He did not know if he should be listening.",
      "start_ms": 83210,
      "end_ms": 86343
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "He did not know if he should leave.",
      "start_ms": 86343,
      "end_ms": 88966
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "He stayed very still.",
      "start_ms": 88966,
      "end_ms": 90569
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Finally Yiayia said, \"Sit for a while.",
      "start_ms": 90569,
      "end_ms": 93410
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Sit for as long as you want.",
      "start_ms": 93410,
      "end_ms": 95524
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "There is no rush.",
      "start_ms": 95524,
      "end_ms": 96835
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "I have been running this inn for many years.",
      "start_ms": 96835,
      "end_ms": 100114
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Some people come here who are having a hard time.",
      "start_ms": 100114,
      "end_ms": 103757
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Sometimes it helps them to just be somewhere for a night.",
      "start_ms": 103757,
      "end_ms": 107983
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Somewhere that is not their life.",
      "start_ms": 107983,
      "end_ms": 110460
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Somewhere old.",
      "start_ms": 110460,
      "end_ms": 111553
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "You can be here.",
      "start_ms": 111553,
      "end_ms": 112792
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "You can be here as long as you want.\"",
      "start_ms": 112792,
      "end_ms": 115488
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "The man nodded slowly.",
      "start_ms": 115488,
      "end_ms": 117097
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He held his tea in both hands.",
      "start_ms": 117097,
      "end_ms": 119265
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "He sat there for maybe an hour.",
      "start_ms": 119265,
      "end_ms": 121503
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "He did not talk much more.",
      "start_ms": 121503,
      "end_ms": 123391
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Sometimes he closed his eyes.",
      "start_ms": 123391,
      "end_ms": 125489
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Sometimes he looked at the shelf on the wall where all the small objects sat.",
      "start_ms": 125489,
      "end_ms": 130945
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Yiayia sat with him.",
      "start_ms": 130945,
      "end_ms": 132413
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Kostas sat too, still pretending to read.",
      "start_ms": 132413,
      "end_ms": 135351
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Eventually the man said he was tired.",
      "start_ms": 135351,
      "end_ms": 138008
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Yiayia showed him upstairs.",
      "start_ms": 138008,
      "end_ms": 139967
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "She came back down.",
      "start_ms": 139967,
      "end_ms": 141366
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "She sat with Kostas for a minute in the kitchen.",
      "start_ms": 141366,
      "end_ms": 144862
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "\"Yiayia,\" said Kostas.",
      "start_ms": 144862,
      "end_ms": 146471
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "He was scared.",
      "start_ms": 146471,
      "end_ms": 147520
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "He whispered.",
      "start_ms": 147520,
      "end_ms": 148499
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "\"Is he going to be all right.\" Yiayia thought about this.",
      "start_ms": 148499,
      "end_ms": 152556
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "She said, \"I hope so.",
      "start_ms": 152556,
      "end_ms": 154094
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I do not know.",
      "start_ms": 154094,
      "end_ms": 155144
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "But I think — I think if he was going to do what he was thinking about, he would not have stopped here.",
      "start_ms": 155144,
      "end_ms": 162417
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "He stopped because he did not want to.",
      "start_ms": 162417,
      "end_ms": 165145
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Some part of him did not want to.",
      "start_ms": 165145,
      "end_ms": 167523
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "So the part of him that does not want to is still there.",
      "start_ms": 167523,
      "end_ms": 171509
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "That is a good sign.",
      "start_ms": 171509,
      "end_ms": 172978
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "But I am not sure.\" She looked at Kostas.",
      "start_ms": 172978,
      "end_ms": 175916
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "\"Do not be afraid.",
      "start_ms": 175916,
      "end_ms": 177244
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "We just — we let him stay.",
      "start_ms": 177244,
      "end_ms": 179133
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "That is what we do.",
      "start_ms": 179133,
      "end_ms": 180532
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "That is all we can do.",
      "start_ms": 180532,
      "end_ms": 182140
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "In the morning we see what happens.\"",
      "start_ms": 182140,
      "end_ms": 184798
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Kostas sat for a long time in the kitchen after Yiayia went to bed.",
      "start_ms": 184798,
      "end_ms": 189554
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "He was awake for hours.",
      "start_ms": 189554,
      "end_ms": 191232
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "He listened.",
      "start_ms": 191232,
      "end_ms": 192141
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "He did not hear the man moving upstairs.",
      "start_ms": 192141,
      "end_ms": 195009
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "He did not hear the motorcycle.",
      "start_ms": 195009,
      "end_ms": 197247
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "He did not hear anything at all.",
      "start_ms": 197247,
      "end_ms": 199555
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Eventually he fell asleep on the kitchen bench, his head on his arms.",
      "start_ms": 199555,
      "end_ms": 204521
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "When Kostas woke up it was morning.",
      "start_ms": 204521,
      "end_ms": 207038
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "The man was in the kitchen.",
      "start_ms": 207038,
      "end_ms": 208997
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "He was sitting at the table drinking coffee.",
      "start_ms": 208997,
      "end_ms": 212144
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "His hair was damp.",
      "start_ms": 212144,
      "end_ms": 213473
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "He looked tired but he looked — he looked more present than he had the night before.",
      "start_ms": 213473,
      "end_ms": 219418
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Yiayia was making eggs.",
      "start_ms": 219418,
      "end_ms": 221096
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "The man said, quietly, to Yiayia, \"Thank you for last night.",
      "start_ms": 221096,
      "end_ms": 225363
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I do not know why I stopped.",
      "start_ms": 225363,
      "end_ms": 227391
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "But I am glad I did.\" Yiayia only nodded.",
      "start_ms": 227391,
      "end_ms": 230328
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She set a plate of eggs in front of him.",
      "start_ms": 230328,
      "end_ms": 233196
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "She said, \"Eat.",
      "start_ms": 233196,
      "end_ms": 234315
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "You need it.\"",
      "start_ms": 234315,
      "end_ms": 235224
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "He ate slowly.",
      "start_ms": 235224,
      "end_ms": 236209
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "When he was finished, he stood up.",
      "start_ms": 236209,
      "end_ms": 238508
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "He was going to go on.",
      "start_ms": 238508,
      "end_ms": 240018
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He did not say where.",
      "start_ms": 240018,
      "end_ms": 241463
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "He paid for the room.",
      "start_ms": 241463,
      "end_ms": 242908
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "He shook Yiayia's hand and held it for a moment longer than usual.",
      "start_ms": 242908,
      "end_ms": 247309
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "He looked at Kostas and nodded.",
      "start_ms": 247309,
      "end_ms": 249410
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "He said to both of them, \"I do not know what I am going to do next.",
      "start_ms": 249410,
      "end_ms": 253876
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "But I am going to see the day.",
      "start_ms": 253876,
      "end_ms": 255912
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "I am going to see this day, at least.",
      "start_ms": 255912,
      "end_ms": 258408
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "That is more than I thought I would.\" And he went out.",
      "start_ms": 258408,
      "end_ms": 262020
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "They heard the motorcycle start.",
      "start_ms": 262020,
      "end_ms": 264188
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "They heard it go down the road, back the way it had come the night before.",
      "start_ms": 264188,
      "end_ms": 269114
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Toward the north.",
      "start_ms": 269114,
      "end_ms": 270362
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Yiayia found it when she went upstairs to strip the bed.",
      "start_ms": 270362,
      "end_ms": 274105
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "She came down with something small in her hand.",
      "start_ms": 274105,
      "end_ms": 277258
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "It was a single silver key on a small piece of dark leather cord.",
      "start_ms": 277258,
      "end_ms": 281592
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "It was worn.",
      "start_ms": 281592,
      "end_ms": 282446
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "It was old.",
      "start_ms": 282446,
      "end_ms": 283234
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "She said, \"He left this on the pillow.\" She turned it over in her palm.",
      "start_ms": 283234,
      "end_ms": 287963
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Kostas came and looked.",
      "start_ms": 287963,
      "end_ms": 289539
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "\"What is it for,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 289539,
      "end_ms": 291313
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "\"I don't know,\" said Yiayia.",
      "start_ms": 291313,
      "end_ms": 293217
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "\"It is a key.",
      "start_ms": 293217,
      "end_ms": 294137
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "It probably opens something somewhere.",
      "start_ms": 294137,
      "end_ms": 296698
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Someone will never know where it went.",
      "start_ms": 296698,
      "end_ms": 299260
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "But he chose this to leave.",
      "start_ms": 299260,
      "end_ms": 301099
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He carried it with him last night and today he chose to leave it here.\"",
      "start_ms": 301099,
      "end_ms": 305893
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "She looked at Kostas.",
      "start_ms": 305893,
      "end_ms": 307338
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "\"That is a decision.",
      "start_ms": 307338,
      "end_ms": 308717
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "That is a small decision he made this morning.",
      "start_ms": 308717,
      "end_ms": 311804
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Instead of doing what he was thinking about doing last night.",
      "start_ms": 311804,
      "end_ms": 315876
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "He chose to leave a key at a crossroads.\" She held out the key.",
      "start_ms": 315876,
      "end_ms": 320079
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "\"You put it on the shelf.",
      "start_ms": 320079,
      "end_ms": 321787
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "And write it in the book.\" So Kostas took the key, and he set it on the shelf, beside the small carved wooden fish and the small river pebble.",
      "start_ms": 321787,
      "end_ms": 331179
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "And he opened the ledger and he wrote, in careful handwriting: A silver key on a leather cord.",
      "start_ms": 331179,
      "end_ms": 337418
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "A man on a motorcycle who was thinking of doing something bad and stopped here instead.",
      "start_ms": 337418,
      "end_ms": 343198
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "He did not tell us his name.",
      "start_ms": 343198,
      "end_ms": 345103
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "But he left the key.",
      "start_ms": 345103,
      "end_ms": 346482
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Then he closed the book, and he put it away.",
      "start_ms": 346482,
      "end_ms": 349437
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "He never found out what happened to the man.",
      "start_ms": 349437,
      "end_ms": 352393
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "But every time, for the rest of his life, that he thought about the shelf of small things, he thought of the key first, and he hoped.",
      "start_ms": 352393,
      "end_ms": 361128
    }
  ]
}